cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: ATAC Regulome
abstract: Gene regulation per cell type from single-nucleus ATAC (multiome). Pseudobulk MACS3 peaks per
  label through SnapATAC2, a merged peak set, marker peaks per label, JASPAR motif enrichment of the marker
  peaks and, with the RNA side, peak-to-gene links from correlation across pseudo-cells.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/atac-regulome
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
- single-cell
- single-nucleus
- multiome
- atac-seq
- genomics
- gene-regulation
